ns and he's  pursued by one of the suspects  he tackles him right here and as you can  see there's a struggle if this was a  robbery why chase him tackle him and  take him away if this is truly just a  simple robbery once he runs away you let  him go this is about more than just  money it's definitely about more than  money where are you two sir what  happened  and tracy smith  and tracy smith joins us now what a  story tracy from that beautiful home to  the bloody crime scene and that grainy  surveillance video it makes me wonder if  authorities had video like that were  they able to identify suspects quickly  well actually no because even though you  could see what happened in that video it  was tough to see who did it because it  was so grainy so investigators spent  months analyzing digital data looking at  more surveillance video until finally  they were able to piece together what  happened  go ahead  well do investigators think it was  related to the cannabis business because  you've got the safe in the house but  then they take them to the farm  right you know  we were told that tushar did everything  by the book but some investors did  accuse him of dealing in the black  market so this was something else that  investigators had to look into  just a really grisly story and a  fascinating mystery looking forward to  it tracy smith thank you very much and  you can see tracy's report who shot the  tech exec on 48 hours tomorrow night at  10 9 central right here on cbs and on  our streaming service paramount plus  we'll be right back

